## 📝 DOCUMENTATION UPDATE TRIGGERS

### Automatic Update Triggers:

**Update `developer-progress-reporting-system/BLUEPRINT.md` when:**

- Adding new features
- Making architecture decisions
- Changing technical design
- Planning new functionality
- Documenting design patterns

**Update `developer-progress-reporting-system/PROGRESS.md` when:**

- Completing features
- Making progress on tasks
- Fixing bugs
- Reaching milestones
- Changing project status

### Update Frequency:

- **Real-time**: Update immediately after making changes
- **Before commits**: Ensure documentation is updated
- **After features**: Always update after completing features
- **Weekly review**: Review and update documentation weekly

